---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { business } from '../data/site.js';
---
<Base
  title="About Aleah Hancock | Bend Doula | Innate Doula Care"
  description="Meet Aleah Hancock, a state-certified doula, lactation counselor and car seat technician in Bend, Oregon, and a two-time surrogate."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap two">
      <div class="stack">
        <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
        <h1>Hi, I'm Aleah</h1>
        <p class="lead">Pronounced uh-lee-uh. I am a full spectrum doula based in Bend, Oregon.</p>
        <p>I was born and raised in the California Bay Area, and life brought me to Bend after having my two kids in my early twenties. Before starting my own family I studied Early Childhood Education and Development, which is where my passion for supporting families began.</p>
        <p>My path changed when someone close to me faced fertility challenges. That led me into the world of third-party reproduction and to being a surrogate twice. One of those journeys brought the gift of new life. The other brought lessons in resilience and compassion through loss. Both shape how I support families today.</p>
        <p>I believe every experience is unique and deserves personalized, inclusive and non-judgmental care. My job is to help you feel confident in your choices.</p>
        <p>When I am not doing birth work, you can find me being "Aunt Nutsy" to nine nieces and nephews, camping, hiking, dancing, playing board games, puzzling or reading.</p>
        <div class="btn-row"><a class="btn" href={business.booking}>Book a free consultation</a></div>
      </div>
      <div class="stack">
        <div class="portrait placeholder"><p><b>A real photo of Aleah goes here.</b> People hire a person, so this is the most important image on the site.</p></div>
        <p class="label">Certification, training and education</p>
        <ul class="checks">
          <li>THW Certified Doula, Oregon Health Authority</li>
          <li>Certified Lactation Counselor (CLC), ALPP</li>
          <li>Child Passenger Safety Technician, Safe Kids Worldwide</li>
          <li>Certified Placenta Specialist, Brilliant Birth Academy</li>
          <li>BLS certified: adult and pediatric CPR/AED, American Red Cross</li>
          <li>Oregon Doula Association member</li>
          <li>DONA-approved birth and postpartum doula workshops, 2023</li>
          <li>Six month birth doula mentorship, Doula Love, 2023 to 2024</li>
          <li>VBAC trained, 2024</li>
          <li>Trauma-informed care training for birth workers, 2024</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <figure class="scene">
    <img src="/img/lake.jpg" width="1920" height="720" alt="Illustration of the Cascade peaks reflected in a lake at dawn" />
    <figcaption>The Cascade Lakes, west of Bend</figcaption>
  </figure>
</Base>

<style>
  .portrait { aspect-ratio: 4 / 5; max-width: 380px; border-radius: 200px 200px 14px 14px; display: flex; align-items: flex-end; }
</style>
